{"id": "EUVD-2026-82987", "enisaUuid": "e71a8c85-d0c4-315c-9bdf-84acc4db9e59", "description": "PLANET IGS-5225-8P2T4S industrial managed switch V1 and V2 firmware versions before 1.2412b260707 and 2.2412b260519 contain an OS command injection vulnerability in the web server. User-supplied input is passed to system() without sufficient filtering, allowing a remote authenticated attacker to execute arbitrary commands on the underlying operating system and escalate privileges to root.", "datePublished": "2026-09-18T15:13:21", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-21T20:50:57", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://www.planet.com.tw/en/support/security-advisory/11", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/planet-igs-5225-8p2t4s-v1-v2-os-command-injection-via-web-server"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-81942", "GHSA-gw63-h58m-r4wr"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 1.9, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "299354e2-f14a-3636-a33b-f320a3948cad", "product": {"name": "PLANET IGS-5225-8P2T4S V2", "vendor": {"name": "PLANET Technology Corp."}}, "product_version": "0 <2.2412b260519"}, {"id": "d68e60d4-e673-3166-a4e6-56454cbc8a43", "product": {"name": "PLANET IGS-5225-8P2T4S V1", "vendor": {"name": "PLANET Technology Corp."}}, "product_version": "0 <1.2412b260707"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "684394f7-df3a-30a2-8a1e-eb7007917e4e", "vendor": {"name": "PLANET Technology Corp."}}], "isExploited": false}